1
00:00:09,560 --> 00:00:10,430
Don't do this.

2
00:00:10,450 --> 00:00:12,020
I'm your uncle, Chen.

3
00:00:13,380 --> 00:00:14,210
So you still remember

4
00:00:14,210 --> 00:00:15,810
what you used to call me.

5
00:00:17,650 --> 00:00:18,510
I remember.

6
00:00:18,760 --> 00:00:19,830
Don't do this.

7
00:00:21,310 --> 00:00:22,640
Put me down, okay?

8
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:26,870
You remember,

9
00:00:28,990 --> 00:00:31,630
but you haven't called me that
for 15 years.

10
00:00:32,659 --> 00:00:34,400
Don't do this. Let's sit down—

11
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:35,600
Weixia.

12
00:00:37,920 --> 00:00:39,520
You owe me this.

13
00:00:50,680 --> 00:00:51,610
It's all your fault

14
00:00:51,610 --> 00:00:53,670
for forcing me to treat you like this.

15
00:00:54,870 --> 00:00:56,140
You betrayed me.

16
00:00:58,630 --> 00:01:00,120
You promised to stay by my side,

17
00:01:00,120 --> 00:01:02,650
but you abandoned me
because you were scared.

18
00:01:07,790 --> 00:01:09,720
This is wrong. You're crazy.

19
00:01:11,350 --> 00:01:12,880
Then go crazy with me.

20
00:02:43,710 --> 00:02:46,950
[Shinji: Double Shuffle] [Episode 1]

21
00:03:00,820 --> 00:03:02,520
Leave the Fan family.

22
00:03:04,450 --> 00:03:06,250
Go as far away as possible.

23
00:03:13,690 --> 00:03:14,960
Don't hate him.

24
00:03:16,760 --> 00:03:18,290
Don't hate anyone.

25
00:03:18,570 --> 00:03:19,500
If you're alive,

26
00:03:21,290 --> 00:03:22,420
I won't hate anyone.

27
00:03:33,150 --> 00:03:34,550
Do you still remember

28
00:03:36,140 --> 00:03:38,250
the wish you told me?

29
00:03:41,320 --> 00:03:43,180
To leave the Fan family

30
00:03:44,920 --> 00:03:47,120
and be with the person you like forever.

31
00:03:49,990 --> 00:03:51,500
Wishes are fake.

32
00:03:51,920 --> 00:03:54,350
If you believe them, they will come true.

33
00:04:03,410 --> 00:04:04,680
Don't hate anyone.

34
00:04:07,480 --> 00:04:08,990
Learn to love.

35
00:04:14,410 --> 00:04:16,269
Love yourself well.

36
00:04:18,430 --> 00:04:20,100
Love the person you love.

37
00:04:20,410 --> 00:04:21,510
Only you.

38
00:04:24,560 --> 00:04:25,450
Mom.

39
00:04:29,680 --> 00:04:30,820
I only have you.

40
00:04:46,600 --> 00:04:47,170
Mom.

41
00:04:47,190 --> 00:04:47,900
Don't...

42
00:04:50,150 --> 00:04:56,060
Don't be tied down by the name Fanjiang.

43
00:04:56,220 --> 00:04:58,950
You have your own life.

44
00:05:01,390 --> 00:05:05,620
You will definitely meet

45
00:05:05,720 --> 00:05:11,820
the person you love
and the person who loves you.

46
00:05:13,690 --> 00:05:15,260
Stop talking.

47
00:05:17,490 --> 00:05:20,630
Don't... Don't be like me.

48
00:05:21,880 --> 00:05:25,850
Because of cowardice,

49
00:05:27,160 --> 00:05:34,330
I missed... out on...

50
00:05:36,810 --> 00:05:39,500
-Mom.
-The happiness I truly want.

51
00:05:50,250 --> 00:05:52,620
Mom, look at me.

52
00:05:54,220 --> 00:05:55,920
Look at me.

53
00:05:58,590 --> 00:05:59,650
Mom.

54
00:06:00,420 --> 00:06:01,250
Mom.

55
00:06:04,580 --> 00:06:06,990
Don't leave me.

56
00:06:11,800 --> 00:06:20,310
Wenfei. Wenfei!

57
00:06:21,370 --> 00:06:22,610
Don't be afraid.

58
00:06:26,110 --> 00:06:27,080
I'm here.

59
00:06:32,520 --> 00:06:34,220
I'm here to take you away.

60
00:06:55,420 --> 00:06:56,860
That day I realized

61
00:06:57,840 --> 00:06:59,840
Mom was always
waiting for someone.

62
00:07:01,150 --> 00:07:04,960
The most important person
in her life wasn't me.

63
00:07:42,020 --> 00:07:44,990
Are you okay?

64
00:07:48,430 --> 00:07:49,670
My name is Fan Weixia.

65
00:07:52,030 --> 00:07:53,440
You should call me Uncle.

66
00:07:54,140 --> 00:07:55,740
Your dad is the second child.

67
00:07:56,040 --> 00:07:58,340
I'm the 7th, your seventh uncle.

68
00:08:07,640 --> 00:08:10,540
My mom passed away last month.

69
00:08:13,850 --> 00:08:15,410
I cried for 7 days.

70
00:08:18,660 --> 00:08:22,160
I would cry every time I woke up.

71
00:08:26,530 --> 00:08:29,570
After my mom was gone,
I was the only one left at home.

72
00:08:31,410 --> 00:08:33,409
It wasn't until my dad came to find me

73
00:08:34,059 --> 00:08:35,960
that I realized I wasn't alone.

74
00:08:38,669 --> 00:08:39,809
I still have family.

75
00:08:43,570 --> 00:08:44,800
You have family too.

76
00:08:45,350 --> 00:08:48,150
Your grandpa is very worried about you.

77
00:08:53,530 --> 00:08:54,460
Me too.

78
00:08:56,610 --> 00:08:59,010
Even though this is
our first time meeting,

79
00:09:00,740 --> 00:09:03,780
I'm just like you,

80
00:09:05,360 --> 00:09:06,760
and I know how sad you are.

81
00:09:09,480 --> 00:09:13,050
When I think of my mom now,

82
00:09:17,110 --> 00:09:18,810
I still want to cry.

83
00:09:27,360 --> 00:09:28,580
You're not alone.

84
00:09:29,600 --> 00:09:31,470
I will always be by your side.

85
00:09:35,460 --> 00:09:36,620
Always

86
00:09:39,340 --> 00:09:40,740
by my side?

87
00:09:44,300 --> 00:09:47,080
Always, forever,

88
00:09:48,060 --> 00:09:49,560
I will be by your side.

89
00:10:21,870 --> 00:10:22,980
I used to

90
00:10:23,630 --> 00:10:26,380
believe his "always" and "forever."

91
00:10:28,040 --> 00:10:29,040
Until...

92
00:10:36,420 --> 00:10:37,290
Chen!

93
00:10:37,750 --> 00:10:40,280
Why did you walk so fast?
Couldn't you wait up?

94
00:10:40,290 --> 00:10:41,690
Why should I wait for you?

95
00:10:43,130 --> 00:10:44,430
Fanjiang Ruichen!

96
00:10:59,480 --> 00:11:01,280
When the kidnapper called me,

97
00:11:01,910 --> 00:11:02,920
why did you react?

98
00:11:03,860 --> 00:11:05,520
I was just curious
who would dare call you that.

99
00:11:05,520 --> 00:11:07,050
Who knew it was a kidnapper?

100
00:11:12,010 --> 00:11:13,110
Stop squirming!

101
00:11:14,440 --> 00:11:15,220
The rope is tied so tight.

102
00:11:15,220 --> 00:11:16,820
You can't untie it like this.

103
00:11:22,630 --> 00:11:23,490
Let me help you.

104
00:11:31,250 --> 00:11:32,380
Quit moving around.

105
00:11:32,480 --> 00:11:34,080
Someone will come to save us.

106
00:11:35,270 --> 00:11:37,070
My dad? So fast?

107
00:11:38,330 --> 00:11:39,290
We've been discovered!

108
00:11:39,290 --> 00:11:40,150
Take them away!

109
00:11:41,700 --> 00:11:42,830
Still trying to run?

110
00:11:42,830 --> 00:11:43,830
Go away!

111
00:11:45,760 --> 00:11:46,790
Chen!

112
00:11:48,470 --> 00:11:49,900
Let me go!

113
00:11:51,440 --> 00:11:52,640
Get up!

114
00:11:55,140 --> 00:11:55,880
Go away!

115
00:12:00,680 --> 00:12:01,450
Come here!

116
00:12:02,720 --> 00:12:03,580
Chen!

117
00:12:05,900 --> 00:12:06,660
Come here!

118
00:12:09,420 --> 00:12:10,160
Chen!

119
00:12:11,260 --> 00:12:12,030
Go away!

120
00:12:12,030 --> 00:12:13,030
Fan Weixia!

121
00:12:14,620 --> 00:12:15,720
Stop hitting him!

122
00:12:16,500 --> 00:12:17,870
Let me go, Fan Weixia!

123
00:12:20,240 --> 00:12:21,670
Let me go, Fan Weixia!

124
00:12:23,320 --> 00:12:24,730
Stop hitting him!

125
00:12:36,430 --> 00:12:37,210
Male patient,

126
00:12:37,210 --> 00:12:37,860
14 years old,

127
00:12:37,860 --> 00:12:39,400
multiple rib fractures on the right side,

128
00:12:39,400 --> 00:12:40,300
suspected hemothorax.

129
00:12:40,300 --> 00:12:41,100
Prepare for thoracotomy!

130
00:12:41,100 --> 00:12:43,500
-Notify the thoracotomy team!
-Yes, okay.

131
00:12:51,230 --> 00:12:54,300
Why did you save me, Fan Weixia?

132
00:13:00,390 --> 00:13:01,680
Why didn't you let the driver pick you up?

133
00:13:01,680 --> 00:13:03,010
That's the person you sent to monitor me.

134
00:13:03,010 --> 00:13:05,270
If I don't monitor you,
how can I save you?

135
00:13:05,790 --> 00:13:07,180
If Wenfei hadn't appointed me

136
00:13:07,180 --> 00:13:08,970
as the estate administrator in her will,

137
00:13:08,970 --> 00:13:10,830
you would have been dead long ago.

138
00:13:11,150 --> 00:13:11,920
You should be very grateful

139
00:13:11,920 --> 00:13:14,260
that you carry her blood.

140
00:13:15,570 --> 00:13:17,190
That's the only reason I let you be alive.

141
00:13:17,190 --> 00:13:18,590
I'm not your chess piece!

142
00:13:19,820 --> 00:13:21,020
Only those with true,

143
00:13:21,920 --> 00:13:24,250
absolute power can crush everything

144
00:13:24,900 --> 00:13:26,500
and become the chess player.

145
00:13:27,090 --> 00:13:28,930
If you don't live past 25,

146
00:13:29,300 --> 00:13:30,400
Wenfei's trust estate

147
00:13:30,400 --> 00:13:31,970
will all go to charity.

148
00:13:32,710 --> 00:13:34,240
If you live to 25

149
00:13:34,240 --> 00:13:35,140
but lack the ability,

150
00:13:35,140 --> 00:13:35,910
I'm sorry,

151
00:13:36,470 --> 00:13:38,270
but these billions will be mine.

152
00:13:39,340 --> 00:13:41,110
If you live past 25

153
00:13:41,660 --> 00:13:43,160
and have the ability,

154
00:13:44,380 --> 00:13:46,810
you will be the true heir
of the Jiang family.

155
00:13:46,810 --> 00:13:47,620
However,

156
00:13:49,240 --> 00:13:52,100
I am the one who judges
whether you have the ability.

157
00:13:53,210 --> 00:13:57,070
Right now, I only see your stupidity
and overestimation of yourself!

158
00:13:57,350 --> 00:14:00,610
Do you really think there are good people
in the Fan family?

159
00:14:02,190 --> 00:14:02,950
What?

160
00:14:04,030 --> 00:14:06,230
If you're not convinced, get stronger.

161
00:14:07,350 --> 00:14:08,880
You can even kill me by then.

162
00:14:27,800 --> 00:14:31,460
You still remembered to protect Ruichen
when you were kidnapped.

163
00:14:32,120 --> 00:14:33,490
You did a great job.

164
00:14:35,540 --> 00:14:36,170
Dad.

165
00:14:39,430 --> 00:14:41,560
I don't want to stay with Chen anymore.

166
00:14:43,840 --> 00:14:45,460
I know I promised you

167
00:14:45,700 --> 00:14:46,900
to stay with him

168
00:14:48,180 --> 00:14:49,580
and be his friend.

169
00:14:51,050 --> 00:14:53,050
But I really can't protect him.

170
00:14:55,750 --> 00:14:57,180
I can't do it.

171
00:14:59,670 --> 00:15:00,840
I'm sorry.

172
00:15:02,970 --> 00:15:06,230
Do you really think there are good people
in the Fan family?

173
00:15:16,830 --> 00:15:18,500
I will always be by your side.

174
00:15:19,840 --> 00:15:22,040
Always, forever,

175
00:15:22,610 --> 00:15:24,420
I will be by your side.

176
00:15:28,390 --> 00:15:29,130
Grandpa.

177
00:15:33,180 --> 00:15:35,280
You should learn from Ruichen.

178
00:15:35,870 --> 00:15:37,740
You two were both kidnapped.

179
00:15:37,760 --> 00:15:39,960
Look how calm he is.

180
00:15:41,010 --> 00:15:41,610
I...

181
00:15:41,630 --> 00:15:43,160
Don't blame Seventh Uncle.

182
00:15:43,470 --> 00:15:45,800
You raised and taught me
when I was little.

183
00:15:46,230 --> 00:15:49,890
It's Seventh Uncle's first time
encountering this kind of thing.

184
00:15:51,630 --> 00:15:54,270
I'm sorry. It's all because of me.

185
00:15:55,630 --> 00:15:57,290
I bought these things for you.

186
00:15:57,630 --> 00:15:59,890
If you need anything else, I'll go buy it.

187
00:16:11,590 --> 00:16:13,250
At that moment, I understood.

188
00:16:14,510 --> 00:16:16,170
Your collar is messed up here.

189
00:16:18,020 --> 00:16:19,300
If you want something

190
00:16:19,960 --> 00:16:23,090
to last forever, let it end
at its most beautiful moment.

191
00:16:25,660 --> 00:16:27,400
Otherwise, you should use all your schemes

192
00:16:27,400 --> 00:16:28,800
to grab them in your hands

193
00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:32,060
and mold them into the shape you want.

194
00:17:08,260 --> 00:17:09,460
He'll wear this suit.

195
00:17:09,520 --> 00:17:10,260
Got it.

196
00:17:14,910 --> 00:17:15,980
I think...

197
00:17:18,069 --> 00:17:20,400
Just this one. You picked well.

198
00:17:35,850 --> 00:17:36,980
Where are you going?

199
00:17:37,620 --> 00:17:38,520
To pay.

200
00:17:38,810 --> 00:17:40,710
I should pay for the suit

201
00:17:40,740 --> 00:17:43,470
I'm wearing to my dad's
birthday banquet myself.

202
00:17:43,870 --> 00:17:46,330
It's not something
an R4 like you can afford.

203
00:17:47,270 --> 00:17:48,200
Put it on my tab.

204
00:17:54,770 --> 00:17:57,000
I'm taking the surgical specialty exam
next month.

205
00:17:57,000 --> 00:17:58,260
I'll pay you back after the exam.

206
00:17:58,260 --> 00:17:59,990
Consider it a gift for passing.

207
00:18:00,210 --> 00:18:01,110
I haven't taken it yet.
How do you know I—

208
00:18:01,110 --> 00:18:02,110
Then pass it.

209
00:18:02,870 --> 00:18:03,830
Otherwise...

210
00:18:08,570 --> 00:18:10,370
Take it off and give it back to me.

211
00:18:35,060 --> 00:18:36,120
Hello, Dr. Fan.

212
00:18:36,140 --> 00:18:36,810
Hello.

213
00:18:39,080 --> 00:18:40,080
It's Dr. Fan.

214
00:18:41,010 --> 00:18:42,080
Thank you, Dr. Fan.

215
00:18:42,080 --> 00:18:42,450
Thank you.

216
00:18:42,450 --> 00:18:44,550
My dad's surgery was very successful.

217
00:18:44,550 --> 00:18:45,660
I owe it all to you.

218
00:18:45,680 --> 00:18:47,380
He's recovering very well now.

219
00:18:47,380 --> 00:18:48,450
It's nothing.

220
00:18:48,470 --> 00:18:49,890
Remember to take care of your health.

221
00:18:49,890 --> 00:18:50,970
-Thank you.
-Thank you.

222
00:18:50,970 --> 00:18:51,670
Alright.

223
00:18:56,260 --> 00:18:56,930
Dr. Fan.

224
00:18:58,630 --> 00:19:00,780
Could you place the orders for Bed 207?

225
00:19:01,120 --> 00:19:03,920
We need to redraw blood for Patient 207.

226
00:19:03,940 --> 00:19:05,700
-Got it.
-Put the report on my desk when it's out.

227
00:19:05,700 --> 00:19:06,440
Okay.

228
00:19:06,460 --> 00:19:07,120
Alright.

229
00:19:08,140 --> 00:19:09,400
Alright, Dr. Fan.

230
00:19:09,430 --> 00:19:10,540
It's about time.

231
00:19:10,570 --> 00:19:11,900
You should get off work.

232
00:19:13,860 --> 00:19:15,730
Okay. Thank you, Qi.

233
00:19:15,750 --> 00:19:16,720
I'll head back then.

234
00:19:16,720 --> 00:19:18,020
Be careful on the road.

235
00:19:21,700 --> 00:19:24,170
Head Nurse, why are you so nice to him?

236
00:19:24,820 --> 00:19:26,180
You're new here, so you don't know.

237
00:19:26,180 --> 00:19:28,570
He's the son of the big boss
behind our hospital.

238
00:19:28,570 --> 00:19:29,210
Him?

239
00:19:29,680 --> 00:19:31,010
He's of Pan-Asia Group?

240
00:19:31,790 --> 00:19:32,690
Oh, right.

241
00:19:33,090 --> 00:19:34,960
His surname is Fan.

242
00:19:35,370 --> 00:19:36,800
Isn't the big boss
in his seventies or eighties?

243
00:19:36,800 --> 00:19:38,340
He's the seventh child.

244
00:19:39,000 --> 00:19:40,260
Unbelievable.

245
00:19:43,260 --> 00:19:45,350
Rich people just know
how to take care of themselves,

246
00:19:45,350 --> 00:19:46,920
still having kids at that age.

247
00:19:46,920 --> 00:19:49,200
What are you thinking about?
Go draw blood.

248
00:19:49,200 --> 00:19:50,600
Yes, Head Nurse.

249
00:20:01,420 --> 00:20:02,120
Honey.

250
00:20:02,570 --> 00:20:05,070
Dad usually throws a big banquet
for his birthday.

251
00:20:05,070 --> 00:20:07,270
Why is it only a family dinner this year?

252
00:20:08,500 --> 00:20:10,170
Maybe there's something to announce

253
00:20:10,170 --> 00:20:11,660
that's not for outsiders to hear.

254
00:20:11,660 --> 00:20:13,520
It's better to keep a low profile.

255
00:20:13,680 --> 00:20:16,080
The lower the profile,
the bigger the deal.

256
00:20:16,180 --> 00:20:18,440
Could it be related to
Pan-Asia's arrangements?

257
00:20:18,440 --> 00:20:19,960
Dad is getting old.

258
00:20:20,240 --> 00:20:22,100
It's time he makes arrangements.

259
00:20:23,120 --> 00:20:25,030
Second Sister-in-Law is right.

260
00:20:25,900 --> 00:20:28,760
Who knows how many more birthdays
he can celebrate.

261
00:20:29,090 --> 00:20:29,820
Fan Jiahong.

262
00:20:31,860 --> 00:20:34,830
Just joking. Why so serious?

263
00:20:36,860 --> 00:20:38,120
Well, Second Brother,

264
00:20:38,330 --> 00:20:40,720
even if it's really about Pan-Asia,

265
00:20:41,240 --> 00:20:42,500
what are you afraid of?

266
00:20:43,240 --> 00:20:45,440
You have it easy with a son like Ruichen.

267
00:20:46,280 --> 00:20:50,650
He alone can feed your whole family.

268
00:20:51,390 --> 00:20:53,250
Who says there's only Ruichen?

269
00:20:54,120 --> 00:20:55,390
There's also him.

270
00:20:56,940 --> 00:20:58,030
Dad, careful.

271
00:21:04,160 --> 00:21:04,790
Dad.

272
00:21:05,310 --> 00:21:07,130
Dad, happy birthday!

273
00:21:07,300 --> 00:21:08,410
Second Brother, Second Sister-in-Law.

274
00:21:08,410 --> 00:21:09,270
Third Brother.

275
00:21:10,970 --> 00:21:13,210
Dad, I'm really sorry.

276
00:21:13,240 --> 00:21:16,500
Wanru said she has to accompany Ruihua
to his Harvard interview.

277
00:21:16,500 --> 00:21:17,630
She said she was really sorry

278
00:21:17,630 --> 00:21:19,720
she couldn't make it back
in time for your birthday.

279
00:21:19,720 --> 00:21:21,860
Everyone should be here.

280
00:21:23,000 --> 00:21:24,630
Well, let's see.

281
00:21:24,650 --> 00:21:27,060
The elders are all here.
Where are the young ones?

282
00:21:27,060 --> 00:21:29,990
Ruichen and Ruizhong
have no concept of time.

283
00:21:30,010 --> 00:21:32,740
Dad, I'll definitely
teach them a lesson for you.

284
00:21:32,950 --> 00:21:33,420
Dad.

285
00:21:33,650 --> 00:21:35,120
I can walk by myself.

286
00:21:35,910 --> 00:21:37,450
You're the healthiest.

287
00:21:44,990 --> 00:21:47,050
Since when did you learn to slack off?

288
00:21:47,960 --> 00:21:49,990
With the Second Brother
and the Third Brother here,

289
00:21:49,990 --> 00:21:51,050
they don't need me.

290
00:21:52,130 --> 00:21:52,730
Indeed.

291
00:21:53,530 --> 00:21:56,030
The one who needs you isn't them...

292
00:21:57,610 --> 00:21:58,280
It's me.

293
00:22:23,760 --> 00:22:25,100
Don't talk nonsense.

294
00:22:25,910 --> 00:22:27,050
My wound opened up.

295
00:22:44,210 --> 00:22:45,550
How did it open up?

296
00:22:48,430 --> 00:22:49,690
None of your business.

297
00:22:51,830 --> 00:22:53,290
Then don't ask for my help.

298
00:23:01,600 --> 00:23:02,680
You owe me this.

299
00:23:09,120 --> 00:23:10,850
I don't want to study business.

300
00:23:12,200 --> 00:23:14,240
Can you help me persuade my dad

301
00:23:14,510 --> 00:23:16,170
to let me go to medical school?

302
00:23:16,910 --> 00:23:19,580
Live with me, and I'll help.

303
00:23:32,240 --> 00:23:33,840
I know you helped and talked my dad

304
00:23:33,840 --> 00:23:36,160
into agreeing to let me
go to medical school back then.

305
00:23:36,160 --> 00:23:38,400
But that's a separate matter
from you getting hurt.

306
00:23:38,400 --> 00:23:39,980
I don't want to pay you back
by saving you.

307
00:23:39,980 --> 00:23:40,980
Then...

308
00:23:43,620 --> 00:23:45,220
how do you want to pay me back?

309
00:23:48,460 --> 00:23:50,320
Instead of using medical skills,

310
00:23:51,390 --> 00:23:52,790
are you...

311
00:23:53,740 --> 00:23:55,140
going to use...

312
00:24:00,800 --> 00:24:01,630
money?

313
00:24:04,100 --> 00:24:05,760
Do you have more money than me?

314
00:24:10,340 --> 00:24:13,200
I'm not done taping it.
Bear with it a little longer.

315
00:24:45,210 --> 00:24:45,950
All right.

316
00:24:46,400 --> 00:24:47,460
Does it still hurt?

317
00:25:09,380 --> 00:25:11,910
Keep the wound dry
for the next couple of days.

318
00:25:13,990 --> 00:25:15,550
Brother, Seventh Uncle!

319
00:25:16,030 --> 00:25:17,050
The suit is here.

320
00:25:19,550 --> 00:25:21,170
Why are you glaring at me?

321
00:25:21,200 --> 00:25:23,050
Are you blaming me for being late?

322
00:25:23,050 --> 00:25:24,120
Come on.

323
00:25:24,190 --> 00:25:25,760
The suit shop is super far
from our hometown.

324
00:25:25,760 --> 00:25:27,060
You know that.

325
00:25:32,480 --> 00:25:33,110
Help me.

326
00:25:36,270 --> 00:25:38,470
I'll clean this up and wait for you guys.

327
00:26:29,520 --> 00:26:30,950
Excuse me, coming through!

328
00:26:30,950 --> 00:26:32,880
It's heavy!

329
00:26:34,240 --> 00:26:36,190
Clear the cup, come on.

330
00:26:41,380 --> 00:26:44,050
Happy birthday, Dad.

331
00:26:46,720 --> 00:26:47,840
I hope your blessings

332
00:26:47,840 --> 00:26:49,740
pile up like these gold ingots,

333
00:26:49,770 --> 00:26:51,690
growing higher and weightier.

334
00:26:55,100 --> 00:26:56,030
Jiahong.

335
00:26:56,970 --> 00:27:00,830
This gift really suits your image.

336
00:27:01,160 --> 00:27:03,090
Thank you for the compliment, Dad.

337
00:27:04,480 --> 00:27:06,150
I'll put it away for you.

338
00:27:10,240 --> 00:27:12,240
I really admire your third brother.

339
00:27:12,590 --> 00:27:13,890
Just during dinner,

340
00:27:13,920 --> 00:27:17,120
Dad announced the handover
of Pan-Asia Group to Ruichen;

341
00:27:17,210 --> 00:27:19,270
he will assume leadership in 3 years.

342
00:27:19,600 --> 00:27:22,060
And he still has the mood
to give gold ingots?

343
00:27:23,740 --> 00:27:24,540
All right.

344
00:27:26,750 --> 00:27:27,850
So lively here!

345
00:27:28,520 --> 00:27:29,020
Zherui?

346
00:27:29,040 --> 00:27:29,720
Zherui.

347
00:27:31,350 --> 00:27:32,750
Zherui, why are you here?

348
00:27:33,090 --> 00:27:33,630
Let's go.

349
00:27:35,240 --> 00:27:36,270
It's a family dinner today.

350
00:27:36,270 --> 00:27:37,400
Don't make a scene. Go back.

351
00:27:37,400 --> 00:27:38,260
Family dinner?

352
00:27:38,840 --> 00:27:41,410
I'm part of the Fan family,
so I should definitely be here.

353
00:27:41,410 --> 00:27:43,050
Sorry, everyone, I'm late.

354
00:27:43,080 --> 00:27:44,000
Sorry.

355
00:27:49,360 --> 00:27:49,960
Grandpa.

356
00:27:52,720 --> 00:27:53,850
Happy birthday.

357
00:27:54,750 --> 00:27:56,040
What is the meaning of this?

358
00:27:56,040 --> 00:27:57,340
Why would you give an elder
a clock for their birthday?

359
00:27:57,340 --> 00:27:58,840
An elder's time is precious!

360
00:27:58,840 --> 00:28:00,210
I want him to cherish his time.

361
00:28:00,210 --> 00:28:01,540
Got a problem with that?

362
00:28:02,930 --> 00:28:05,870
Grandpa, I carefully picked this for you.

363
00:28:06,560 --> 00:28:09,620
I want to specially thank you
for arranging my marriage

364
00:28:09,710 --> 00:28:11,240
and suddenly foisting a fiancée

365
00:28:11,240 --> 00:28:12,950
on me I've never even met.

366
00:28:27,360 --> 00:28:29,030
The Fan family

367
00:28:31,090 --> 00:28:32,820
doesn't raise useless people.

368
00:28:34,890 --> 00:28:37,390
Grandpa, you should make it clear.

369
00:28:37,860 --> 00:28:40,390
You mean people
who are useless to you, right?

370
00:28:48,020 --> 00:28:49,260
I won't get married.

371
00:28:51,390 --> 00:28:52,890
If you continue to insist,

372
00:28:53,160 --> 00:28:55,090
it won't be as simple
as giving you a clock.

373
00:28:55,090 --> 00:28:56,490
If you don't get married,

374
00:28:57,240 --> 00:28:58,850
from today on,

375
00:28:59,160 --> 00:29:01,390
stop using the Fan family name!

376
00:29:08,850 --> 00:29:10,510
Thank you for the return gift.

377
00:29:12,310 --> 00:29:13,480
Mr. Fan,

378
00:29:14,550 --> 00:29:15,640
happy birthday.

379
00:29:16,150 --> 00:29:16,860
Bye-bye.

380
00:29:18,770 --> 00:29:19,830
What are you doing?

381
00:29:19,880 --> 00:29:21,480
Clean it up and throw it away!

382
00:29:24,380 --> 00:29:27,510
No one dares to hire someone
who offended the Fan family.

383
00:29:30,340 --> 00:29:31,740
He will let you know that

384
00:29:32,900 --> 00:29:35,160
without the Fan family, you are nothing.

385
00:29:36,870 --> 00:29:39,200
There are always places beyond his reach.

386
00:29:39,830 --> 00:29:41,230
No matter what, I'm free.

387
00:29:42,630 --> 00:29:44,490
But you're still trapped inside.

388
00:29:44,630 --> 00:29:45,790
Good luck, little brother.

389
00:29:45,790 --> 00:29:47,190
I'm not like you.

390
00:29:47,730 --> 00:29:48,840
This place is mine.

391
00:29:49,920 --> 00:29:50,580
I'm staying here

392
00:29:50,580 --> 00:29:52,580
just to take back what belongs to me.

393
00:30:02,050 --> 00:30:03,750
Dad, please don't be angry.

394
00:30:04,190 --> 00:30:05,360
Give me some time.

395
00:30:05,380 --> 00:30:06,980
I'll bring Zherui over

396
00:30:07,010 --> 00:30:08,740
to kowtow and apologize to you.

397
00:30:09,900 --> 00:30:10,700
Yeah, Dad.

398
00:30:10,920 --> 00:30:12,760
Jiahe and I will persuade him.

399
00:30:12,800 --> 00:30:14,350
About the marriage
to the Zhang family's daughter,

400
00:30:14,350 --> 00:30:16,410
there will definitely be no problem.

401
00:30:17,240 --> 00:30:18,950
Second Brother, Second Sister-in-Law,

402
00:30:18,950 --> 00:30:21,150
this matter has caused such a big scene.

403
00:30:21,310 --> 00:30:23,520
He sent an unlucky gift.

404
00:30:24,230 --> 00:30:26,290
How exactly did you raise your child?

405
00:30:35,090 --> 00:30:35,630
Me?

406
00:30:37,920 --> 00:30:40,450
I... I can't.

407
00:30:40,470 --> 00:30:41,940
I...

408
00:30:41,970 --> 00:30:43,040
I like men!

409
00:30:49,420 --> 00:30:51,260
Say that to me one more time.

410
00:30:52,070 --> 00:30:54,140
Grandpa, I... I can't.

411
00:30:54,170 --> 00:30:55,420
I... I really can't.

412
00:30:55,420 --> 00:30:57,380
Because...

413
00:30:59,850 --> 00:31:00,750
Grandpa.

414
00:31:01,410 --> 00:31:02,740
He is still useful to me.

415
00:31:13,730 --> 00:31:14,600
Weixia.

416
00:31:20,530 --> 00:31:23,500
You're not young anymore, are you?

417
00:31:32,180 --> 00:31:34,480
Dad, I agree to get married.

418
00:32:19,200 --> 00:32:21,900
You want to get married that much,
Seventh Uncle?

419
00:32:21,900 --> 00:32:22,470
You...

420
00:34:03,990 --> 00:34:05,190
Let me go.

421
00:34:05,900 --> 00:34:07,360
I'll leave and go far away.

422
00:34:09,690 --> 00:34:11,020
You can have a try.

423
00:34:12,010 --> 00:34:14,070
Let's see if you can escape in the end,

424
00:34:15,300 --> 00:34:16,699
or if I can make you stay.
